--TEST--
a `Core` constant has a value and no signature, so hovering one answers the one sentence its registry row carries, `rule:core-api/reference-card`
--FILE--
<?nvs
var $turn = Core\Math::P<|>I * 2.0;
echo $turn;
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
```nvs
Core\Math::PI
```

The ratio of a circle's circumference to its diameter, `3.14159…` as the nearest `float` — PHP's `M_PI`.
